    /**
    * A relation recorded on a model. Delete behavior is stored and not executed.
    *
    * For belongsTo, the foreign key property is on this model. For hasOne and hasMany
    * it is on the related model. belongsToMany names a pivot table and the two pivot
    * foreign-key columns instead.
    */
